@walletUrl = http://localhost:8080
@balancesUrl = http://localhost:3003
@aliceAccountId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@bobAccountId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### 1. Saldo inicial de Alice: 1000.00000000
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{aliceAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Saldo inicial de Bob: 500.00000000
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{bobAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Transferir 100 de Alice para Bob pelo Wallet Core
POST {{walletUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id_from": "{{aliceAccountId}}",
  "account_id_to": "{{bobAccountId}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### Aguarde o consumo assíncrono antes de executar as consultas seguintes.

### 4. Saldo esperado de Alice após a transferência: 900.00000000
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{aliceAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Saldo esperado de Bob após a transferência: 600.00000000
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{bobAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Conta sem projeção: HTTP 404
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
